# The Gift (otherAreas 21): Oswald's 71 against The Real Gift's 74 (both Event, both accepted by a GM: no setting
# needed): they take turns, The_Gift first: 71, then 74, then 71. A Progress 71 (or 74) would play every time. The trade
# reply (72 Progress) has no competitor (The Real Gift answers a Shall Shell only): XI.Verify.Quests `oa g2 kinds`. 70's
# and 78's kinds are in `#offer` (against 73).
lists Selbina/Oswald/onTrigger
char zone=Selbina pos=48.6,-15.3,8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.UnderTheSea completed
quest OtherAreas.TheSandCharm completed
quest OtherAreas.TheGift accepted
quest OtherAreas.TheRealGift accepted
login
trigger Oswald                          # 71 (a tie with 74: The Gift's first)
finish
trigger Oswald                          # 74 (4484)
finish
trigger Oswald                          # 71 again
finish
